{"seq":2,"slug":"pr-code-review-english","title":"PR 与 Code Review 英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/pr-code-review-english","wordCount":1533,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"pr-与-code-review-英语\">PR 与 Code Review 英语</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PR 与 Code Review 的英语共用一个底层结构：<strong>先给结论与上下文，再给细节</strong>。PR description 用 <code>What / Why / How / Testing / Notes</code> 分节，commit message 用精炼的祈使句标题加可选正文，review 评论用严重性前缀加具体建议——三者都是把&quot;我做了什么 / 为什么 / 请你做什么&quot;用固定骨架表达出来。</p>\n<p>这套语言里最关键的机制是<strong>严重性前缀与表达梯度</strong>。前缀（<code>blocker:</code> / <code>nit:</code> / <code>suggestion:</code>）把&quot;这条评论有多重要&quot;提前说清；表达梯度则让你在&quot;直接请求&quot;和&quot;委婉建议&quot;之间按团队文化选档。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PR 与 Review 英语] --&gt; B[PR 描述骨架]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Commit message]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Review 评论]&#10;    B --&gt; E[What Why How Testing Notes]&#10;    C --&gt; F[祈使句标题 type scope 描述]&#10;    D --&gt; G[严重性前缀]&#10;    D --&gt; H[表达梯度]&#10;    G --&gt; I[blocker issue nit suggestion praise]&#10;    H --&gt; J[直接请求 / 委婉建议 / 替代方案]&#10;    E --&gt; K[清晰 具体 尊重]&#10;    F --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[PR 与 Review 英语] --&gt; B[PR 描述骨架]\n    A --&gt; C[Commit message]\n    A --&gt; D[Review 评论]\n    B --&gt; E[What Why How Testing Notes]\n    C --&gt; F[祈使句标题 type scope 描述]\n    D --&gt; G[严重性前缀]\n    D --&gt; H[表达梯度]\n    G --&gt; I[blocker issue nit suggestion praise]\n    H --&gt; J[直接请求 / 委婉建议 / 替代方案]\n    E --&gt; K[清晰 具体 尊重]\n    F --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K</pre><p>四个场景反复出现同一组要求：<strong>清晰</strong>（说清改了什么）、<strong>具体</strong>（引用文件、函数、数字）、<strong>尊重</strong>（承认对方的工作）。做到这三点，你的 PR 与 review 就是专业的——语法是否完美反而是次要项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pr-description-写作框架\">PR Description 写作框架</h2><p>Pull Request（PR）描述是开发者技术写作中最高频的场景。一个好的 PR Description 能让 Reviewer 在查看代码之前就理解改动的目的、范围和影响，大幅提升审查效率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pr-title-的写作公式\">PR Title 的写作公式</h3><p>PR Title 应当是一个简洁的句子，遵循以下格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;concise description of what this PR does&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;type>(&#x3C;scope>): &#x3C;concise description of what this PR does></span></span></code></pre></div><p>高频 type 前缀及其含义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前缀</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>feat</code></td>\n<td>新功能</td>\n<td><code>feat(auth): add OAuth2 login with Google</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fix</code></td>\n<td>修复 Bug</td>\n<td><code>fix(cart): resolve race condition in quantity update</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>refactor</code></td>\n<td>重构</td>\n<td><code>refactor(api): extract validation logic into middleware</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>perf</code></td>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td><code>perf(query): add index for user lookup by email</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>docs</code></td>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td><code>docs(api): update authentication examples</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>test</code></td>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td><code>test(payment): add integration tests for Stripe webhook</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chore</code></td>\n<td>杂项</td>\n<td><code>chore(deps): upgrade React to v19</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Title 写作要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保持在 72 个字符以内</li>\n<li>使用祈使句（imperative mood）：&quot;Add feature&quot; 而非 &quot;Added feature&quot;</li>\n<li>说明&quot;做了什么&quot;而非&quot;在做什么&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pr-body-模板\">PR Body 模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## What&#10;&#10;Brief description of what this PR does (1-3 sentences).&#10;&#10;## Why&#10;&#10;The motivation behind these changes. Link to issue if applicable. Fixes #123&#10;&#10;## How&#10;&#10;Describe the approach taken and any important design decisions.&#10;&#10;## Testing&#10;&#10;- [ ] Unit tests added/updated&#10;- [ ] Integration tests pass&#10;- [ ] Manual testing done (describe what was tested)&#10;&#10;## Screenshots (if applicable)&#10;&#10;Before / After screenshots for UI changes.&#10;&#10;## Notes for Reviewers&#10;&#10;Any specific areas where you&#39;d like focused feedback.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## What</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Brief description of what this PR does (1-3 sentences).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Why</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">The motivation behind these changes. Link to issue if applicable. Fixes #123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## How</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Describe the approach taken and any important design decisions.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Testing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Unit tests added/updated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Integration tests pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Manual testing done (describe what was tested)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Screenshots (if applicable)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Before / After screenshots for UI changes.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Notes for Reviewers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Any specific areas where you'd like focused feedback.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实际-pr-description-示例\">实际 PR Description 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## What&#10;&#10;Add rate limiting to the public API endpoints using a sliding window algorithm with Redis as the backing store.&#10;&#10;## Why&#10;&#10;Our API has been experiencing abuse from automated scrapers, causing degraded performance for legitimate users. This implements the rate limiting strategy agreed upon in ADR-047.&#10;&#10;## How&#10;&#10;- Implemented sliding window counter using Redis MULTI/EXEC&#10;- Added `RateLimitMiddleware` that checks limits before routing&#10;- Default limit: 100 requests per minute per API key&#10;- Returns 429 with `Retry-After` header when limit exceeded&#10;&#10;## Testing&#10;&#10;- Unit tests for the sliding window algorithm&#10;- Integration tests with Redis test container&#10;- Load tested with k6: confirmed correct behavior at 200 rps&#10;&#10;## Notes for Reviewers&#10;&#10;The Redis key expiration strategy in `rate-limiter.ts:45-60` could use a second look. I&#39;m not 100% sure the TTL handling is correct for edge cases near the window boundary.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## What</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Add rate limiting to the public API endpoints using a sliding window algorithm with Redis as the backing store.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Why</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Our API has been experiencing abuse from automated scrapers, causing degraded performance for legitimate users. This implements the rate limiting strategy agreed upon in ADR-047.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## How</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Implemented sliding window counter using Redis MULTI/EXEC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Added </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`RateLimitMiddleware`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> that checks limits before routing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Default limit: 100 requests per minute per API key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Returns 429 with </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`Retry-After`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> header when limit exceeded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Testing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Unit tests for the sliding window algorithm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Integration tests with Redis test container</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Load tested with k6: confirmed correct behavior at 200 rps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Notes for Reviewers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">The Redis key expiration strategy in </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`rate-limiter.ts:45-60`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> could use a second look. I'm not 100% sure the TTL handling is correct for edge cases near the window boundary.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"code-review-评论表达\">Code Review 评论表达</h2><p>Code Review 评论需要在&quot;清晰传达技术观点&quot;和&quot;维护团队关系&quot;之间取得平衡。英语中有一套成熟的表达梯度系统来实现这一点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"评论严重性前缀\">评论严重性前缀</h3><p>在评论开头使用标准前缀来表示严重程度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前缀</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>必须修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>blocker:</code></td>\n<td>阻塞问题，不修不能合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>issue:</code></td>\n<td>需要修改的问题</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nit:</code></td>\n<td>小瑕疵，改不改都行</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>suggestion:</code></td>\n<td>建议，可以讨论</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>question:</code></td>\n<td>需要作者解释</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>praise:</code></td>\n<td>写得好的地方</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>thought:</code></td>\n<td>发散想法，不针对本次 PR</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"请求修改的表达梯度\">请求修改的表达梯度</h3><p><strong>直接请求</strong>（适合明确的问题）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;This should be extracted into a separate function.&quot;&#10;&quot;Please rename this variable to something more descriptive.&quot;&#10;&quot;We need to add error handling here.&quot;&#10;&quot;This constant should be defined at the module level.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"This should be extracted into a separate function.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Please rename this variable to something more descriptive.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We need to add error handling here.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This constant should be defined at the module level.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>委婉建议</strong>（团队中更受欢迎的风格）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;What do you think about extracting this into a helper?&quot;&#10;&quot;Could we consider using a more descriptive name here?&quot;&#10;&quot;Would it make sense to add a try-catch block around this?&quot;&#10;&quot;I wonder if we could simplify this with a reduce().&quot;&#10;&quot;Have you considered using a Map instead of an object here?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"What do you think about extracting this into a helper?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Could we consider using a more descriptive name here?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Would it make sense to add a try-catch block around this?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I wonder if we could simplify this with a reduce().\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Have you considered using a Map instead of an object here?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>提供替代方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;One alternative approach could be...&quot;&#10;&quot;Another option would be to...&quot;&#10;&quot;We could potentially simplify this by...&quot;&#10;&quot;A pattern I&#39;ve seen work well for this is...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"One alternative approach could be...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Another option would be to...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We could potentially simplify this by...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"A pattern I've seen work well for this is...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提问的表达方式\">提问的表达方式</h3><p><strong>询问意图/原因</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;What&#39;s the reasoning behind this approach?&quot;&#10;&quot;Could you help me understand why we&#39;re doing it this way?&quot;&#10;&quot;Is there a specific reason for choosing X over Y?&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m curious about the motivation for this change.&quot;&#10;&quot;What led to this design decision?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"What's the reasoning behind this approach?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Could you help me understand why we're doing it this way?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Is there a specific reason for choosing X over Y?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm curious about the motivation for this change.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"What led to this design decision?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>确认行为</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Just to confirm — this will also handle the case when X is null?&quot;&#10;&quot;Does this work correctly when the list is empty?&quot;&#10;&quot;Have we considered what happens if the API returns a 5xx?&quot;&#10;&quot;Will this be backwards-compatible with the existing clients?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Just to confirm — this will also handle the case when X is null?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Does this work correctly when the list is empty?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Have we considered what happens if the API returns a 5xx?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Will this be backwards-compatible with the existing clients?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>询问边界情况</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;What happens if the user submits the form twice rapidly?&quot;&#10;&quot;How does this behave under high concurrency?&quot;&#10;&quot;Have we accounted for the timezone differences here?&quot;&#10;&quot;Is there a maximum size limit we should validate against?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"What happens if the user submits the form twice rapidly?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"How does this behave under high concurrency?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Have we accounted for the timezone differences here?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Is there a maximum size limit we should validate against?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"给予肯定\">给予肯定</h3><p>好的 Code Review 不只是挑问题，还要肯定优秀的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Nice refactoring! This is much cleaner.&quot;&#10;&quot;Great catch on the edge case handling.&quot;&#10;&quot;I like this approach — it&#39;s both simple and extensible.&quot;&#10;&quot;TIL! I didn&#39;t know about this API. Thanks for introducing it.&quot;&#10;&quot;Clever use of generics here. Very elegant solution.&quot;&#10;&quot;This test is really thorough. Good coverage of edge cases.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Nice refactoring! This is much cleaner.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Great catch on the edge case handling.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I like this approach — it's both simple and extensible.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"TIL! I didn't know about this API. Thanks for introducing it.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Clever use of generics here. Very elegant solution.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This test is really thorough. Good coverage of edge cases.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理分歧\">处理分歧</h3><p>当你和 PR 作者意见不同时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I see your point, but I&#39;m slightly concerned about...&quot;&#10;&quot;I understand the trade-off you&#39;re making here. My concern is...&quot;&#10;&quot;I think we might want to discuss this further before merging.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s sync on this offline — I think there might be a misunderstanding.&quot;&#10;&quot;I could be wrong here, but my understanding is that...&quot;&#10;&quot;Fair point — I&#39;ll defer to your judgment on this one.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I see your point, but I'm slightly concerned about...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I understand the trade-off you're making here. My concern is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think we might want to discuss this further before merging.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's sync on this offline — I think there might be a misunderstanding.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I could be wrong here, but my understanding is that...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Fair point — I'll defer to your judgment on this one.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"code-review-常用缩略语\">Code Review 常用缩略语</h2><p>技术团队中使用一套简洁的缩略语来提高沟通效率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LGTM</td>\n<td>Looks Good To Me</td>\n<td>审阅通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SGTM</td>\n<td>Sounds Good To Me</td>\n<td>同意你的方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PTAL</td>\n<td>Please Take A Look</td>\n<td>请审阅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIP</td>\n<td>Work In Progress</td>\n<td>还没做完</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RFC</td>\n<td>Request For Comments</td>\n<td>征求意见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TL;DR</td>\n<td>Too Long; Didn&#39;t Read</td>\n<td>摘要（用于长文前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AFAIK</td>\n<td>As Far As I Know</td>\n<td>据我所知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IIRC</td>\n<td>If I Recall Correctly</td>\n<td>如果我没记错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IMO / IMHO</td>\n<td>In My (Humble) Opinion</td>\n<td>个人看法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FYI</td>\n<td>For Your Information</td>\n<td>供参考</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NB</td>\n<td>Nota Bene</td>\n<td>注意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WDYT</td>\n<td>What Do You Think?</td>\n<td>你觉得怎样？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TBD</td>\n<td>To Be Decided/Determined</td>\n<td>待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>Not Applicable</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"commit-message-英语\">Commit Message 英语</h2><h3 id=\"conventional-commits-规范\">Conventional Commits 规范</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&lt;type&gt;[optional scope]: &lt;description&gt;&#10;&#10;[optional body]&#10;&#10;[optional footer(s)]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;type>[optional scope]: &#x3C;description></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[optional body]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[optional footer(s)]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用 description 动词（祈使句）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"add       — 添加新功能/文件&#10;remove    — 移除功能/文件&#10;update    — 更新已有功能&#10;fix       — 修复问题&#10;refactor  — 重构（不改变行为）&#10;improve   — 改善性能/可读性&#10;implement — 实现（新功能）&#10;replace   — 替换实现&#10;simplify  — 简化逻辑&#10;extract   — 提取为独立模块&#10;migrate   — 迁移到新方案&#10;deprecate — 标记为弃用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>add       — 添加新功能/文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>remove    — 移除功能/文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>update    — 更新已有功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fix       — 修复问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>refactor  — 重构（不改变行为）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>improve   — 改善性能/可读性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>implement — 实现（新功能）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>replace   — 替换实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>simplify  — 简化逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extract   — 提取为独立模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>migrate   — 迁移到新方案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deprecate — 标记为弃用</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实际-commit-message-示例\">实际 Commit Message 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"feat(auth): implement JWT refresh token rotation&#10;&#10;Add automatic token refresh when access token expires within 5 minutes&#10;of the request. Uses rotating refresh tokens to improve security.&#10;&#10;Breaking change: refresh_token response field is now single-use.&#10;Clients must store the new refresh token from each response.&#10;&#10;Refs: AUTH-234\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>feat(auth): implement JWT refresh token rotation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Add automatic token refresh when access token expires within 5 minutes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>of the request. Uses rotating refresh tokens to improve security.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Breaking change: refresh_token response field is now single-use.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Clients must store the new refresh token from each response.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Refs: AUTH-234</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"fix(search): prevent XSS in search query highlighting&#10;&#10;Sanitize HTML entities in the search term before injecting into&#10;the highlighted result markup. Previously, user input was rendered&#10;as raw HTML which allowed script injection.&#10;&#10;Fixes #891\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fix(search): prevent XSS in search query highlighting</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sanitize HTML entities in the search term before injecting into</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>the highlighted result markup. Previously, user input was rendered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>as raw HTML which allowed script injection.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Fixes #891</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Code Review 英语的核心不在于语法的完美，而在于<strong>清晰</strong>、<strong>具体</strong>、<strong>尊重</strong>。直接指出问题所在、给出具体建议或替代方案、尊重对方的工作付出——这三点做到了，你的 Review 就是专业的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-ai-起草-pr-描述与-review-回复\">用 AI 起草 PR 描述与 Review 回复</h2><p>AI 工具（Claude / GPT / Cursor / Copilot Chat）在 PR 写作链路上有两个高 ROI 入口：<strong>起草 PR description</strong> 与 <strong>整理 review 回复</strong>。但 AI 初稿有典型的&quot;AI 味&quot;，需要人调。</p>\n<h3 id=\"起草-pr-description-的-prompt-模式\">起草 PR description 的 prompt 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"You are drafting a PR description. Given the diff below, produce a&#10;PR description following this template:&#10;&#10;**What**: 1-2 sentences on what changed.&#10;**Why**: the business or technical reason, with linked issue if any.&#10;**How**: 3-5 bullets on the implementation approach.&#10;**Testing**: what was tested manually + what&#39;s covered by automated tests.&#10;**Notes**: optional caveats, follow-ups, or out-of-scope items.&#10;&#10;Constraints:&#10;- Use imperative mood in section bodies (&quot;Add&quot;, &quot;Remove&quot;, &quot;Refactor&quot;).&#10;- Cite specific files/functions affected.&#10;- Do not invent test cases — list only what&#39;s actually present.&#10;- Keep under 200 words.&#10;&#10;Diff:&#10;[paste diff or refer to the staged changes]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>You are drafting a PR description. Given the diff below, produce a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PR description following this template:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**What**: 1-2 sentences on what changed.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**Why**: the business or technical reason, with linked issue if any.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**How**: 3-5 bullets on the implementation approach.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**Testing**: what was tested manually + what's covered by automated tests.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>**Notes**: optional caveats, follow-ups, or out-of-scope items.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Constraints:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Use imperative mood in section bodies (\"Add\", \"Remove\", \"Refactor\").</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Cite specific files/functions affected.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Do not invent test cases — list only what's actually present.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Keep under 200 words.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Diff:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[paste diff or refer to the staged changes]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>明确不要让 AI 编造测试</strong>——这是 LLM 最容易&quot;幻觉&quot;的地方</li>\n<li><strong>指定 imperative mood</strong>——LLM 默认偏向 &quot;This PR adds...&quot;，需要明确切到 &quot;Add...&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>字数上限</strong>——LLM 默认啰嗦；设上限能逼出重点</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"起草-review-reply-的-prompt-模式\">起草 review reply 的 prompt 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"You&#39;re writing a polite review reply. The reviewer asked: &quot;[paste comment]&quot;&#10;My intended response is: &quot;[short Chinese or rough English version]&quot;&#10;&#10;Rewrite this as a concise, professional review reply that:&#10;- Acknowledges the reviewer&#39;s point first&#10;- States my position with a clear reason&#10;- Ends with an open invitation if there&#39;s disagreement&#10;&#10;Avoid &quot;I think&quot; hedging more than once. Avoid &quot;Let me know your thoughts&quot;&#10;if I&#39;ve already given a clear answer.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>You're writing a polite review reply. The reviewer asked: \"[paste comment]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>My intended response is: \"[short Chinese or rough English version]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Rewrite this as a concise, professional review reply that:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Acknowledges the reviewer's point first</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- States my position with a clear reason</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Ends with an open invitation if there's disagreement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Avoid \"I think\" hedging more than once. Avoid \"Let me know your thoughts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if I've already given a clear answer.</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这一个 prompt 设计有意降低了&quot;礼貌冗余&quot;——母语者的 review reply 通常比中文母语者起草的更直接。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ai-起草的-pr-review-的-3-类-ai-味-信号\">AI 起草的 PR / Review 的 3 类&quot;AI 味&quot;信号</h3><p>人调阶段重点检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>AI 味信号</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>怎么改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过度礼貌</td>\n<td>&quot;Thank you so much for your kind feedback! I really appreciate...&quot;</td>\n<td>删到 &quot;Thanks for the review.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊修饰</td>\n<td>&quot;This significantly improves...&quot; / &quot;vastly better&quot;</td>\n<td>改成具体数字 &quot;Reduces p99 from 800ms to 120ms&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复声明</td>\n<td>前文说了 &quot;added tests&quot;，结尾又说 &quot;I&#39;ve also added tests to ensure quality&quot;</td>\n<td>删后者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用-ai-做-review-检查清单\">用 AI 做 review 检查清单</h3><p>AI 不仅能起草，也能反向 review 你自己的 PR description / commit message：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Review my PR description below. Flag:&#10;- Missing context (would a reviewer with no background understand why?)&#10;- Vague statements that should cite specific files/tests/metrics&#10;- Imperative-mood violations (e.g., &quot;This adds X&quot; → &quot;Add X&quot;)&#10;- Length issues (is it under 200 words?)&#10;&#10;[paste your draft]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Review my PR description below. Flag:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Missing context (would a reviewer with no background understand why?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Vague statements that should cite specific files/tests/metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Imperative-mood violations (e.g., \"This adds X\" → \"Add X\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- Length issues (is it under 200 words?)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[paste your draft]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 AI 当成第二双眼睛——但<strong>第一双眼睛仍是你自己</strong>。AI 不知道 codebase 的隐式约定（团队偏好的 PR 长度、不写 &quot;Notes&quot; 节的惯例等），人审不可替代。</p>\n<h3 id=\"review-阶段的-ai-风险\">Review 阶段的 AI 风险</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>不要让 AI 直接 review 别人 PR 的 diff 并发表评论</strong>——这相当于把 AI 的判断当成你的判断，对作者不公平</li>\n<li><strong>可以</strong>让 AI 帮你<strong>理解</strong>别人 PR 的改动（&quot;explain this diff in 5 bullets&quot;），但 review 评论必须是你自己看完后写的</li>\n<li>如果团队接受 AI 辅助 review，<strong>显式标注</strong>：&quot;I used AI to summarize the changes; the comments below are my own.&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PR 与 review 英语共享一个骨架：先结论与上下文，再细节</li>\n<li>PR Title 用 <code>&lt;type&gt;(&lt;scope&gt;): &lt;祈使句描述&gt;</code>，控制在 72 字符内；Body 用 <code>What / Why / How / Testing / Notes for Reviewers</code> 模板</li>\n<li>Commit message 遵循 Conventional Commits，description 用祈使句动词（<code>add</code> / <code>fix</code> / <code>refactor</code> / <code>extract</code>）</li>\n<li>Review 评论用严重性前缀（<code>blocker:</code> / <code>issue:</code> / <code>nit:</code> / <code>suggestion:</code> / <code>praise:</code>）先标重要程度</li>\n<li>掌握表达梯度：直接请求、委婉建议（&quot;What do you think about...&quot;）、提供替代方案，按团队文化选档</li>\n<li>处理分歧、给予肯定、请求澄清各有成熟句型——别把每条评论都写成同一个调子</li>\n<li>团队缩略语能提速：LGTM / SGTM / PTAL / WIP / TL;DR / WDYT</li>\n<li>AI 可起草 PR 描述与 review 回复，但要点明&quot;不要编造测试&quot;、强制祈使句；人调时重点清除&quot;AI 味&quot;（过度礼貌 / 模糊修饰 / 重复声明）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PR 与 Code Review 英语","id":"pr-与-code-review-英语"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PR Description 写作框架","id":"pr-description-写作框架"},{"level":3,"text":"PR Title 的写作公式","id":"pr-title-的写作公式"},{"level":3,"text":"PR Body 模板","id":"pr-body-模板"},{"level":3,"text":"实际 PR Description 示例","id":"实际-pr-description-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Review 评论表达","id":"code-review-评论表达"},{"level":3,"text":"评论严重性前缀","id":"评论严重性前缀"},{"level":3,"text":"请求修改的表达梯度","id":"请求修改的表达梯度"},{"level":3,"text":"提问的表达方式","id":"提问的表达方式"},{"level":3,"text":"给予肯定","id":"给予肯定"},{"level":3,"text":"处理分歧","id":"处理分歧"},{"level":2,"text":"Code Review 常用缩略语","id":"code-review-常用缩略语"},{"level":2,"text":"Commit Message 英语","id":"commit-message-英语"},{"level":3,"text":"Conventional Commits 规范","id":"conventional-commits-规范"},{"level":3,"text":"实际 Commit Message 示例","id":"实际-commit-message-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"用 AI 起草 PR 描述与 Review 回复","id":"用-ai-起草-pr-描述与-review-回复"},{"level":3,"text":"起草 PR description 的 prompt 模式","id":"起草-pr-description-的-prompt-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"起草 review reply 的 prompt 模式","id":"起草-review-reply-的-prompt-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 起草的 PR / Review 的 3 类\"AI 味\"信号","id":"ai-起草的-pr-review-的-3-类-ai-味-信号"},{"level":3,"text":"用 AI 做 review 检查清单","id":"用-ai-做-review-检查清单"},{"level":3,"text":"Review 阶段的 AI 风险","id":"review-阶段的-ai-风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"技术文档阅读策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/reading-technical-docs"},"next":{"title":"技术博客写作英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/technical-reading-writing/tech-blog-writing"}}